# Gauswarn India - Netlify Redirects
# ==========================================

# 1. Redirect www to non-www (PRIMARY FIX)
# Resolves: "Page with redirect" GSC issue
https://www.gauswarn.com/* https://gauswarn.com/:splat 301!

# 2. Redirect product query-params to canonical product page
# Resolves: "Crawled - currently not indexed" for products?v=*
/products?v=*  /products/  301

# 3. Redirect non-existent pages that Google crawled
/track  /  301
/singleproduct  /products/  301

# 4. React SPA fallback (must be last)
/*  /index.html  200
